    <id>rewind</id>
    <name>Rewind</name>
    <summary>Time machine for your files with a ransomware shield</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[**Your cloud can no longer be ruined.**

* **Rewind**: pick a folder and a moment in the past, preview exactly what will change, and bring the folder back as it was. Undo is one click.
* **Ransomware shield**: detects mass encryption in seconds (volume, ransom extensions, ransom notes, encrypted content), freezes the attacking device or account and alerts you.
* **Activity timeline**: see what changed, when and from which device. An attack shows up as a red spike.

Rewind restores what Nextcloud keeps (file versions and the trash bin) and is **not** a replacement for backups.
Requires the core apps "Versions" and "Deleted files".]]></description>
